@host = https://localhost:7270
@contentType = application/json

# ================================================================
# ACCOUNTING BOOK API TEST — Phase A + C
# ================================================================
# Prerequisites:
#   1. Login first (Auth.http → Google Login) → copy accessToken
#   2. Must have an active accounting period (create via AccountingPeriod API)
#   3. Must have a business location (locationId)
#   4. Seed data (058-062) must be applied
#
# Test order:
#   1. Create Books  → create books from template codes
#   2. List Books    → list all books for a period
#   3. Get Summary   → get KPI + column schema for a book
#   4. Get Rows      → cursor-based data rows (placeholder)
# ================================================================

# -------------------- VARIABLES --------------------
# After login, paste your accessToken here:
@accessToken = <PASTE_YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE>

# Your business location ID (check from existing data)
@locationId = 1

# Your accounting period ID (must be an active period)
@periodId = 1

# After creating books, copy bookId here:
@bookId = 1


### ====================================================
### 1. CREATE BOOKS — Nhóm 1 (Exempt, chỉ S1a)
### ====================================================
### Expected: 201 Created
### Creates 1 book (S1a) per tax profile group
### ====================================================
POST {{host}}/api/locations/{{locationId}}/accounting/books
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "periodId": {{periodId}},
    "groupNumber": 1,
    "taxMethod": "exempt",
    "templateCodes": ["S1a"]
}


### ====================================================
### 2. CREATE BOOKS — Nhóm 2, Cách 1 (chỉ S2a)
### ====================================================
### Expected: 201 Created
### S2a is for method_1 only
### ====================================================
POST {{host}}/api/locations/{{locationId}}/accounting/books
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "periodId": {{periodId}},
    "groupNumber": 2,
    "taxMethod": "method_1",
    "templateCodes": ["S2a"]
}


### ====================================================
### 3. CREATE BOOKS — Nhóm 2, Cách 2 (S2b + S2c + S2d + S2e)
### ====================================================
### Expected: 201 Created
### Should create 4 books × N tax profile groups
### ====================================================
POST {{host}}/api/locations/{{locationId}}/accounting/books
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "periodId": {{periodId}},
    "groupNumber": 2,
    "taxMethod": "method_2",
    "templateCodes": ["S2b", "S2c", "S2d", "S2e"]
}


### ====================================================
### 4. CREATE BOOKS — Duplicate check
### ====================================================
### Expected: 201 but CreatedBooks = [] (skip duplicates)
### Running same request again should not create duplicates
### ====================================================
POST {{host}}/api/locations/{{locationId}}/accounting/books
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "periodId": {{periodId}},
    "groupNumber": 1,
    "taxMethod": "exempt",
    "templateCodes": ["S1a"]
}


### ====================================================
### 5. CREATE BOOKS — Invalid template code
### ====================================================
### Expected: 400 TEMPLATE_NOT_FOUND
### ====================================================
POST {{host}}/api/locations/{{locationId}}/accounting/books
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "periodId": {{periodId}},
    "groupNumber": 1,
    "taxMethod": "exempt",
    "templateCodes": ["S99_INVALID"]
}


### ====================================================
### 6. CREATE BOOKS — Wrong group for template
### ====================================================
### Expected: 400 TEMPLATE_NOT_APPLICABLE_GROUP
### S1a chỉ cho Nhóm 1, không cho Nhóm 2
### ====================================================
POST {{host}}/api/locations/{{locationId}}/accounting/books
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "periodId": {{periodId}},
    "groupNumber": 2,
    "taxMethod": "method_1",
    "templateCodes": ["S1a"]
}


### ====================================================
### 7. CREATE BOOKS — Wrong method for template
### ====================================================
### Expected: 400 TEMPLATE_NOT_APPLICABLE_METHOD
### S2a chỉ cho method_1, không cho method_2
### ====================================================
POST {{host}}/api/locations/{{locationId}}/accounting/books
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
    "periodId": {{periodId}},
    "groupNumber": 2,
    "taxMethod": "method_2",
    "templateCodes": ["S2a"]
}


### ====================================================
### 8. LIST BOOKS — Get all books for a period
### ====================================================
### Expected: 200 OK — array of BookListItemDto
### Includes template info, business types, taxProfileKey
### ====================================================
GET {{host}}/api/locations/{{locationId}}/accounting/books?periodId={{periodId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}


### ====================================================
### 9. GET BOOK SUMMARY — KPI + Column schema
### ====================================================
### Expected: 200 OK — BookSummaryResponse
### Returns templateCode, columns (field schema), totals
### ====================================================
GET {{host}}/api/locations/{{locationId}}/accounting/books/{{bookId}}/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}


### ====================================================
### 10. GET BOOK ROWS — Cursor-based pagination
### ====================================================
### Expected: 200 OK — BookRowsResponse (empty for now)
### Phase B will wire render engine for live data
### Response: { rows: [], hasMore: false, nextCursor: null }
### ====================================================
GET {{host}}/api/locations/{{locationId}}/accounting/books/{{bookId}}/rows?batchSize=200
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}


### ====================================================
### 11. GET BOOK ROWS — With cursor (page 2+)
### ====================================================
### Replace cursor value with nextCursor from previous response
### ====================================================
GET {{host}}/api/v1/locations/{{locationId}}/accounting/books/{{bookId}}/rows?cursor=PASTE_NEXT_CURSOR_HERE&batchSize=200
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}


### ====================================================
### 12. GET BOOK ROWS — Max batch size cap
### ====================================================
### batchSize > 200 should be capped to 200
### ====================================================
GET {{host}}/api/v1/locations/{{locationId}}/accounting/books/{{bookId}}/rows?batchSize=999
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}


### ====================================================
### 13. GET BOOK SUMMARY — Invalid bookId
### ====================================================
### Expected: 404 BOOK_NOT_FOUND
### ====================================================
GET {{host}}/api/v1/locations/{{locationId}}/accounting/books/99999/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}


### ====================================================
### 14. NO AUTH — Should fail 401
### ====================================================
### Expected: 401 Unauthorized
### ====================================================
GET {{host}}/api/v1/locations/{{locationId}}/accounting/books?periodId={{periodId}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
